flowchart TD
  A[Versioned prompt] --> B[Development fixture set]
  B --> C[Worker execution]
  C --> D[Independent evaluation]
  D --> E[Failure analysis]
  E --> F[Candidate revision]
  F --> G{Safety + correctness regression?}
  G -->|yes| R[Reject]
  G -->|no| H[Freeze candidate]
  H --> I[Untouched held-out set]
  I --> J[One-sided lower bound]
  J --> K{Target met?}
  K -->|no| N[Inconclusive / not qualified]
  K -->|yes| Q[Qualified for tested conditions]
